      <activity id="165c5091-1b13-5271-9d9a-db5cb6daa7d2" activityNameId="72c994f7-7020-5547-9db8-f932a4820381" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Folding boxboard, FBB, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Folding boxboard, FBB, at plant
na;
Synonyms: Chromokarton, GC; 
UUID: 2e6b70ac-b7b9-369b-9800-65f1ac82059c
This module includes the European production of folding boxboard (FBB) in an integrated mill - including transports to paper mill, wood handling, chemical pulping and bleaching, board production, energy production on-site and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Data from a finnish database, from the former Swiss packaging study and from several CER used as European average data.
Location:  Data from a finnish database, from the former Swiss packaging study and from several CER used as European average data.
Technology: Average of present used technology
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total European boxboard production in 2000: 11'664 kt (CEPI statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2e6b70ac-b7b9-369b-9800-65f1ac82059c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
